# MyCloud

This project is an alternative to iCloud

#Features

- Can store and convert files.
- Supported files for conversion:
   PDF,DOCX,
   PNG, WEBP, JPG,
   MP3, WAV, MP4, MKV
- You can search for files
- Secure connection 
- Website works on any device

